Options with 4 mana:\n\
1.  **`Release the Dogs`** ({3}{W}): Make four 1/1 dogs.\n\
    -   This is huge with `Assault Formation`. They are 1/1s, so they deal 1 damage normally. With Assault Formation, they deal damage equal to toughness (1). No change.\n\
