    -   Hits for 4.\n\
    -   Leaves 1 mana up.\n\
    -   `Spark Reaper` is a Zombie. This is an excellent blocker against it. It blocks it endlessly and can't be touched.\n\
\n\
Comparison:\n\
- Spreading wide with `Release the Dogs` is very strong against single target removal (like their `Spark Reaper` sacrifice ability or spot removal). 4 bodies is a lot of pressure and defense.\n\
- `Grave Bramble` is a solid wall against their Zombie, but they can just sacrifice the zombie for value if they get stuck.\n\
- `Release the Dogs` gives me 4 attackers eventually.\n\
\n\
`Release the Dogs` seems best. It stabilizes the board with chump blockers if needed, or goes wide around their single blocker.\n\
