- `Grave Bramble` (3/4).\n\
  -   Blocks a 4/3.\n\
  -   Rats deals 4 damage to Bramble -> Bramble dies.\n\
  -   Bramble deals 4 damage (toughness) to Rats -> Rats dies.\n\
  -   They trade.\n\
  -   When Rats dies, `Malefic Scythe` gets a counter (+1 counter -> total 2 counters).\n\
- `Wall of Vines` (0/3).\n\
  -   Blocks a 4/3.\n\
  -   Rats deals 4 damage -> Wall dies.\n\
  -   Wall deals 3 damage (toughness) to Rats. Rats has 3 toughness (thanks to Scythe +1/+1). Rats takes 3 damage -> Dies?\n\
