      "decision_index": 110,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Moodmark Painter was cast with no other creatures on board, so its ETB can only target itself for a one-turn +6/+0 and menace boost (making it 8/3). The opponent has Grave Bramble and Gargoyle Sentinel available to double-block, potentially killing it. Meanwhile, Revenant would be a 6/6 flyer (6 creature cards in graveyard) that threatens to end the game in 2 attacks against an opponent at 8 life, and the opponent has very limited ways to block flyers (only Gargoyle Sentinel with 3 mana activation, and they have only 1 untapped land).",
      "action_taken": "Cast Moodmark Painter, a 2/3 with a one-turn ETB buff targeting itself",
