      "decision_index": 113,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Moodmark Painter's Undergrowth trigger was auto-targeted to an opponent's Dog Token due to timeout/passing, giving the opponent's 1/1 Dog menace and +7/+0 (making it 8/1). This helps the opponent enormously while wasting the powerful ETB trigger. The opponent is at 8 life and MstLg Tinker has 7 creatures in graveyard.",
