      "decision_index": 141,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "At 2 life with the opponent at 8, MstLg Tinker is in a desperate racing situation. All of the opponent's creatures are tapped, so only Gargoyle Sentinel (with defender) can block. Sending both Eternal Taskmaster and Soldier Token would force the opponent to let at least one through, dealing 1 extra damage. The 1/1 Soldier Token's defensive value is marginal when the opponent has creatures like Grave Bramble 5/6 that will untap next turn.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with only Eternal Taskmaster, holding back the Soldier Token",
      "better_line": "Attack with both Eternal Taskmaster and Soldier Token to maximize damage through the single available blocker (Gargoyle Sentinel), dealing at least 1 extra damage to the opponent at 8 life",
      "type": "blunder",
