      "decision_index": 143,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gargoyle Sentinel (3/3) could block and kill Eternal Taskmaster (2/3) while surviving. The opponent has only 1 untapped Swamp, making combat tricks extremely unlikely. Not blocking lets the Taskmaster survive to attack again and potentially recur creatures from the graveyard. Taking 2 damage (8→6) is unnecessary when you can kill the attacker for free.",
