    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Player timed out in precombat main phase with opponent at 2 life and clear lethal on board. Should have cast Cathar's Companion for additional insurance and/or prepared for combat. The timeout risks cascading through combat phases, potentially missing lethal.",
