    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent is at 2 life. Gem3P Valley has two 1/1 Dog tokens, a 3/3 Gargoyle Sentinel, and a 5/6 Grave Bramble (with Assault Formation letting creatures deal damage equal to toughness, and Warmonger's Chariot or Assault Formation's ability allowing defenders to attack). The opponent has very limited blockers: Eternal Taskmaster is tapped, Caged Zombie and Fetid Imp are summoning sick, and there's only a 1/1 Soldier token untapped. Attacking with everything would deal far more than 2 damage even through a single block — this is lethal on board. The player timed out and failed to declare any attackers, completely missing a guaranteed lethal attack.",
      "action_taken": "Timed out (no response) and declared no attackers, passing through combat without attacking.",
      "better_line": "Attack with all creatures (two Dog tokens, Gargoyle Sentinel, and Grave Bramble). The opponent can only block one attacker with the 1/1 Soldier token. Even blocking one Dog token, the remaining attackers deal at least 2 damage (another Dog token alone), which is lethal against the opponent's 2 life. Use Assault Formation's {G} ability to let Grave Bramble attack if needed.",
      "type": "blunder",
